From b96aa9b38529b6f6ba268ce72acd39cae99cb4fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yannick Fertre <yannick.fertre@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Jul 2025 10:49:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: fix continuous display on stm32mp1 boards

Patch to fix the "continuous display" functionality.
The back-light is enabled by default, others drivers (ltdc, dsi & panels)
must detect the previous activity to maintains resources after probe.

Change-Id: I4a618a622c29ee1523030ac88357d9b42dcfe4a3
Signed-off-by: Yannick Fertre <yannick.fertre@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/479222
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
